From 99e882da60a0323b184bc02cfd92eb00ac4b56fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: manhpdbiz <manhpdbiz@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 08:45:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(mobile): add Tabula Android Compose app with chess and
 discovery runtime

- Implement Tabula Jetpack Compose mobile app under app/
- Connect game discovery catalog, interactive Chess & TicTacToe state machines
- Add deterministic match history with local Room persistence
- Configure Tabula semantic design tokens, bundled fonts, and adaptive launcher icons
- Set up Android Gradle build configuration with AGP 9 and JVM 21
